{"id":1131201,"name":"노마·심문 I","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"노마·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1131201]}],"trial":{"trial_id":131201,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2026-07-10 14:00:00","diary1":"오늘, 당신은 치안국 방문자로부터 면담 신청서를 받았다. 상대방은 자신의 모델이 위험도가 굉장히 높지만 아직 발생하지 않은 잠재적 위협을 예측해 냈다고 했다.","diary2":"노마는 업그레이드된 예측 모델 '모세 2.0'이 오프라인 방 탈출 게임 <퓨처 리메이크>에 비정상적인 이상 상황이 존재하며, 중대한 위기를 일으킬 가능성이 크다는 결론을 내렸다고 했다. 증거가 아직 충분하지 않음에도, 그녀는 조사를 강행하며 당신의 협조를 요청했다.\n　　한참을 고민한 끝에 당신은 그녀와 함께 게임 현장으로 직접 가서 진실을 파헤쳐보기로 했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260937,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260938,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":1,"dialogue_id":231201007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":3,"dialogue_id":231201009,"next":[10]},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":231201022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,